# Direct portal ↔ seed-root binding for Err's Foresight tree.
# Variable-name contract only. No production values belong here.
#
# How Axxium identifies a signed-in portal user (riatzukiza/axxium#21):
#   session → :auth/actor-id = "actor_<uuid>" (minted at first Google signup).
# Without this binding the portal caller DID is
#   did:web:<host>:actors:actor_<uuid>
# which does NOT match the seed root did:web:<host>:actors:err, so Err
# cannot see or manage the tree after sign-in.
#
# Direct link (Err's decision, Nov 2 2026): set both of these in the
# host-local private .env (never in git). Together they make the signed-in
# human session act as the seed root.
#
# 1. Sign into the Axxium portal once (Google).
# 2. Copy your account id from the account manager (actor_<uuid>).
# 3. Set:
AXXIUM_IDENTITY_ROOT_OPERATOR_ACTOR_ID=actor_<UUID>
AXXIUM_IDENTITY_ROOT_DID=did:web:axxium.promethean.rest:actors:err
#
# Also required for seed application (otherwise Axxium skips the seed):
# AXXIUM_GITHUB_IDENTITY_KEY_FILE=...
# AXXIUM_GITHUB_IDENTITY_LEDGER_FILE=...
# AXXIUM_IDENTITY_SEED_FILE=/etc/axxium/identity/foresight-tree.edn
